error[E0028]: pipe into a call without `_`
  --> tests/ui/05-expressions/pipe_nested_hole.cheby:15:16
   |
15 |   let n = 1 |> apply(add(_, 1))
   |             -- ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this call has no `_` argument
